		{
			description: [
				"Separate raw input, processing stages and finished output. Give every line an overflow plan so a full chest does not cover the floor in entities or jam an unrelated machine."
				"Use filters and labels at boundaries between zones. If a belt carries five unrelated products through the entire factory, a single mistake becomes difficult to trace."
				"Build walkways and sight lines before walls. A factory that can be inspected while running is much easier on both players and the server."
				"Speed controllers change RPM; they do not create extra stress capacity. Diagnose the source and load first, then tune speed for the slowest operation that still meets the factory's actual demand."
