			description: [
				"Steam power and trains are expensive because they connect systems at settlement scale. Plan stations, loading rules and safe track clearances before decorating the locomotive."
				"Test routes with one carriage and one cargo type. Add schedules and automation only after manual journeys work reliably in both directions."
				"In the chronicle, the first railways ended the age of isolated camps. A station is not merely a machine; it is a promise that two places will remain connected."
